      "en": "“‘Sanctify yourselves therefore, and be holy; for I am the LORD your God.",
      "ko": "너희는 스스로 깨끗케 하여 거룩할찌어다 나는 너희 하나님 여호와니라",
      "source_text_hash": "44416eb0a133b8580efad9008de317070adf8f65aac2103a93d69ddcbb7d443f",
      "translation_text_hash": "26e8c19bf777bebfb2ea9dbcedd43ca2c218e73705d0cb115461f1fba8302b5b",
