      "en": "You shall keep my statutes, and do them. I am the LORD who sanctifies you.",
      "ko": "너희는 내 규례를 지켜 행하라 나는 너희를 거룩케 하는 여호와니라",
      "source_text_hash": "447c52e8af21d35a4562e779bcea990fa505b301776cabf54ea1619bf6f982a7",
      "translation_text_hash": "1c060c148f50f0949ce8823ed717826afd568aa8db9b10560b8310cd37bc5c4b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
