      "en": "“‘For everyone who curses his father or his mother shall surely be put to death. He has cursed his father or his mother. His blood shall be upon himself.",
      "ko": "무릇 그 아비나 어미를 저주하는 자는 반드시 죽일찌니 그가 그 아비나 어미를 저주하였은즉 그 피가 자기에게로 돌아가리라",
      "source_text_hash": "211fa1bf360aa38406306735812a93ec52213c48bb10967fa48a79520ba32e17",
      "translation_text_hash": "233ecb5c516617facc0ddfd54c4f6bd356e55d363951deb2e53afa4618ce2c8e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
