      "en": "“‘The man who lies with his father’s wife has uncovered his father’s nakedness. Both of them shall surely be put to death. Their blood shall be upon themselves.",
      "ko": "누구든지 그 계모와 동침하는 자는 그 아비의 하체를 범하였은즉 둘 다 반드시 죽일찌니 그 피가 자기에게로 돌아가리라",
      "source_text_hash": "2cf329eb89f5cf3b6e81d5e003d4246fafed5f1493521f62575bd1d104786cc8",
      "translation_text_hash": "884ec8f3ad63c9c6713dd3ac5429778a2ce74a2dd8738f7f905938a0a842b492",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
